Post Plans: (GEMs here only applied to mail (MGEMs), only GEMs from GEM packs and a Prism One subscription)
    BASIC / FREE: Free | No gems, only free model available (10 GEMs max, no discount, or rollover included.)
    MBronze: $2 / Month | 1 GEM per request -- Plan grants 35 GEMs / Month (rollover not included) {Allows use of Bronze Model for 0.5 GEMs}
    MSilver: $3 / Month | 3 GEMs per request -- Plan grants 55 GEMs / Month (rollover included: up to 150 "rolled over" GEMs) {Allows use of Bronze for 0.5 and Silver for 1.5}
    MGOLD: $7 / Month | 5 GEMs per request -- Plan grants 100 GEMs / Month (rollover included: up to 500 "rolled over" GEMs) {Allows use of Bronze for 0.5, Silver for 1.5, and Gold for 3}

